# Kernel headers placeholder for the Infinix GT 20 Pro (X6871).
#
# The XOS 16.3 kernel is distributed as a prebuilt LZ4 compressed Image
# (6.12.38-android16-5-gb575a0b6e647-ab14355190-4k). No kernel source is
# published for this device, so no kernel headers are shipped.
#
# This directory only exists because BoardConfig.mk points
# TARGET_KERNEL_SOURCE at it; nothing in the build system reads it.
#
